For the base case, if either `i` or `j` is 0, we set `dp[i][j]` to 0 since there are no elements to consider. Otherwise, we calculate `dp[i][j]` as the maximum of `dp[i-1][j]` (excluding `nums1[i-1]`), `dp[i][j-1]` (excluding `nums2[j-1]`), and `nums1[i-1] * nums2[j-1] + max(0, dp[i-1][j-1])` (including both elements).

Finally, we return `dp[n][m]` where `n` and `m` are the lengths of `nums1` and `nums2`, respectively.

