<code>
```python
def maxOperations(nums, k):
    hashmap = {}
    count = 0
    for num in nums:
        complement = k - num
        if complement in hashmap:
            count += 1
            if hashmap[complement] == 1:
                del hashmap[complement]
            else:
                hashmap[complement] -= 1
        else:
            hashmap[num] = hashmap.get(num, 0) + 1
    return count
```
