<solution>
```python
def canReach(arr, start):
    if 0 <= start < len(arr) and arr[start] >= 0:
        if arr[start] == 0:
            return True
        arr[start] = -arr[start]  # Mark as visited
        return canReach(arr, start + arr[start]) or canReach(arr, start - arr[start])
    return False
```
</solution>

