Here’s the function in Python:

```python
def balance_books(expenses):
    total_spent = sum(expenses.values())
    average_spent = total_spent / len(expenses)

    result = {}
    for person, spent in expenses.items():
        share = round(average_spent - spent, 2)
        result[person] = share

    return result
```

