<code>
```python
def namelist(names):
    names_list = [name['name'] for name in names]
    if len(names_list) > 1:
        return ', '.join(names_list[:-1]) + ' & ' + names_list[-1]
    elif len(names_list) == 1:
        return names_list[0]
    else:
        return ''
```
