<code>
```python
def even_or_odd(number):
    if number % 2 == 0:
        return "Even"
    else:
        return "Odd"
```
</code>

<if:sql>
```sql
SELECT number,
       CASE
           WHEN number % 2 = 0 THEN 'Even'
           ELSE 'Odd'
       END AS is_even
FROM numbers;
```
</if>

