<code>
```python
def eq_sum_powdig(hMax, exp):
    def sum_of_powdig(num, exp):
        return sum(int(digit)**exp for digit in str(num))

    return sorted([num for num in range(1, hMax) if sum_of_powdig(num, exp) == num])
```
