We'll start by defining a function ```generate_partitions()``` that generates all possible partitions of  ```n``` into  ```k``` parts. It will use recursion to explore all possibilities.

Next, we'll define another function ```find_spec_partition()``` that takes  ```n```,  ```k```, and the command ('max' or 'min') as arguments. It will use ```generate_partitions()``` to get all possible partitions and then select the one with the desired product.

