<code>
```python
def reverse_bits(n):
    num_bits = 0
    temp = n
    while temp:
        num_bits += 1
        temp >>= 1
    reversed_n = 0
    for i in range(num_bits):
        reversed_n |= (n & 1) << (num_bits - 1 - i)
        n >>= 1
    return reversed_n
```
