def removeDuplicates(nums):
    i = 2
    j = 2

    while j < len(nums):
        if nums[j] != nums[j - 1] or (nums[j] == nums[j - 1] and nums[j] != nums[i - 2]):
            nums[i] = nums[j]
            i += 1
        j += 1

    return i
```
</code>

