<code>
```python
def factorial(n, mod=998244353):
    if n <= 1:
        return 1
    return n * factorial(n - 1) % mod

def count_valid_permutations(n):
    return (n * factorial(n - 1) // 2) % mod

n = int(input())
print(count_valid_permutations(n))
```
</code>

