<solution>
```python
def get_char_weight(char):
    if char.isupper():
        return ord(char) - 64  # 'A' is 65 in ascii, so subtract 64 to get 1-26
    elif char.islower():
        return ord(char) - 96  # 'a' is 97 in ascii, so subtract 96 to get 1-26
    else:
        return 0

def name_weight(name):
    return sum(get_char_weight(char) for char in name if char.isalpha() or char.isspace())
```
