The Chef is planning to buy some stocks. He has a budget of $B$ dollars and wants to buy stocks such that the total cost of the stocks is exactly $B$. The stock prices are given by an array $A$ of length $N$. The Chef wants to buy exactly $K$ stocks such that the total cost is exactly $B$.

